8,Songs in Australia’s First Nations languages - ABC ClassicAustralian Aboriginal Music - 30 Powerful Indigenous Voices ...Australian Traditional Music Archive,https://www.abc.net.au/listen/classic/read-and-watch/music-reads/songs-in-australian-first-nations-languages/13963692,"Jul 7, 2022 · Explore the richness of First Peoples' stories, songs and languages through a selection of classical music featuring languages from different regions across the country. Dec 21, 2024 · Explore our curated collection of Australian Aboriginal Music, highlighting diverse traditions, historical context, and cultural continuity through 30 carefully selected songs. Welcome to the Australian Traditional Music Archive, a repository for collected Australian Traditional Music, with the aim of making these tunes more widely available and used. The tunes are displayed with a music score, abc source, links to recordings, and links to related people and organisations.",Mayaguduna,Australian
